 "measures": [
  {
   "name": "Public Measure NC (Kirkwood Community College GO Bond)",
   "jurisdiction": "Kirkwood Community College (Merged Area X) — appears on 23 of 26 Jones ballots (not Cascade city, Richland Twp, Washington Twp)",
   "ballotLanguage": "Shall Kirkwood Community College (Merged Area X) in the Counties of Benton, Black Hawk, Buchanan, Cedar, Clinton, Delaware, Dubuque, Iowa, Jackson, Jefferson, Johnson, Jones, Keokuk, Linn, Louisa, Poweshiek, Tama, and Washington, be authorized to renovate, improve, erect, and equip facilities to modernize learning spaces with an emphasis on health sciences, industrial technologies, agricultural sciences, and business and information technology, contract indebtedness therefor, and issue General Obligation Bonds in an amount not exceeding $88,000,000 for those purposes?"
  }
 ],
 "notes": "Parsed from official per-township/city sample ballots. Supervisor Districts 3 and 4 appear on every Jones County sample ballot (all 26 styles), so supervisors are elected at-large (countywide vote, residency districts). Brian Wolken (Treasurer) and Kristofer J. Lyons (County Attorney) appear with no party label. Empty candidate lists = no candidate printed (write-in only): Castle Grove Twp Trustee & Clerk, Hale Twp Clerk, Greenfield Twp Trustee (full term), Washington Twp Trustee. Richland Township has two ballot styles (one in the MN school district) with identical township races. No hospital trustee races."
